    "short_label": {
      "en": "$tsceepi_rate2"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "$tsceepi_rate2 (0.40%) is the employee old-age insurance contribution rate applied to the whole (uncapped) gross income, in addition to the rate applied on the capped portion up to the monthly PSS ($tsceepi_rate1). It is used as a Band_Rate in tscee_fr/SchedCalc ('Old Age insurance contributions'). The FR country report (Table 2.57) documents exactly this 0.40% rate for the 'whole income' old-age contribution, matching the constant's current value."
    },
